    <briefdescription>
<para>Polynomial kernel. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Defined for two vectors <bold>x</bold> and <bold>y</bold>:</para>
<para><formula id="37">\[ K(\mathbf{x}, \mathbf{y}) = \big( \gamma*\mathbf{x}^T \mathbf{y} + \mathrm{c} \big)^{\mathrm{d}} \]</formula></para>
<para>Required <ref refid="classConfig" kindref="compound">Config</ref> key: <ref refid="classConfig_1MPARAMS" kindref="member">MPARAMS</ref> &lt;int&gt; d &lt;double&gt; <formula id="38">$ \gamma $</formula> c</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classKern__Base" kindref="compound">Kern_Base</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
